{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>רום</b> — on the pattern of סוג, meaning רום שירים (height of songs); his eyes are in pride, the opposite of שח עינים." "<b>ורחב לב</b> — that He broadens it to endure troubles and fear HaShem." "<b>נר</b> — defective of yod; its meaning is that the wicked one lights and plows, to do sin — the meaning of all three."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:55.689982656Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}